      "id": "claim_bf4a816208b849fcbec8f49d366129d2",
      "statement": "Agent execution in LangChain is orchestrated by a LangGraph StateGraph that maintains typed state (AgentState with messages, jump_to, and structured_response fields), invokes a language model with optional middleware wrapping, dispatches tool calls via conditional edges, accumulates results through message reducers, and terminates based on explicit model decisions, middleware jumps, or completion of structured output.",
