      "id": "claim_0e3bfd70628d4f9a914b8cbe589503fb",
      "statement": "Middleware in agent execution compose in registration order: sequential hooks (before_agent, before_model, after_model, after_agent) run each middleware in order with state flowing forward; wrap_model_call handlers nest with first middleware as outermost layer; tool wrappers similarly nest with first as outermost. Commands from wrap_model_call are accumulated inner-first without merging.",
