      "id": "claim_e0f0a1930a074e628d70b92df760d86d",
      "statement": "Loop control is governed by conditional edge functions that inspect AIMessage tool_calls, tool execution history, structured response state, and middleware jump directives: model_to_tools filters out executed and structured tools then routes to tools or loops back for synthetic messages; tools_to_model checks return_direct and structured output completion; model_to_model retries for structured output generation.",
