      "id": "claim_909a91fd4cbd4b2aa9c65ad9e308e43f",
      "statement": "ModelRequest encapsulates all model invocation parameters (model, messages, tools, response_format, system_message, state, runtime, model_settings) and is immutable, providing an override() method for middleware to create modified requests. ModelResponse wraps the result messages and optional structured_response. ExtendedModelResponse attaches Commands for additional state updates applied through reducers.",
